(text "Carga por el USB-C del TP4056 (IN+/IN- son su conector)." (at 12.7 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a48d89cc-2f1b-4c4e-8cb1-8f8089125415))
(text "D4 es el diodo del elevador y bloquea el retorno del USB del DevKit." (at 12.7 255.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 15c84a09-fcc7-4687-8463-e855875de564))
(text "R13/R14: 4.2 V de bateria -> 2.1 V en GPIO10 (ADC1)." (at 12.7 257.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 04591fe5-7d06-4af3-9ebe-1b56b3462327))
(text "Consumo estimado ~0.9 A de bateria con tiras al 50%:" (at 12.7 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e517e48a-829d-4f8f-ab1c-a43bb3cdbfff))
(text "unas 6.8 h nominales. Limitar tiras a 300 mA (MT3608)." (at 12.7 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid b5ed8fae-c6e5-4106-b7ec-c3e776a99a52))
(text "MT3608: Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + R15/R16) = 5.2 V en el riel, con FB despues de D4." (at 12.7 270.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0f7410b0-6aa4-4f06-827b-80e7b7100468))
(text "EN a VIN. L1 con corriente de saturacion de 3 A o mas." (at 12.7 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d61b24eb-24a1-4cb8-9a0b-30125566b3ac))
(text "OPCION B: diseno discreto con TP4056, interruptor y MT3608 (alternativa a la opcion A)." (at 12.7 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3ded4033-3252-42e9-b83e-f014b244e471))
